- docs/speed-editor-examples/python-bmd/bmd.py (smunaut's protocol core; Apache-2.0)
- docs/speed-editor-examples/python-driver/davinci_speed_editor.py (hardware-verified keycodes; BSD-3)
- docs/speed-editor-examples/cpp-driver/src/key_map.h + hid_device.{h,cpp} (C++ reference)
